  "detail": "Apply only the existing formatter\u2019s JSON layout to the mutable construction registry. Independently compare its complete non-whitespace token sequence and parsed document, not only selected fields or a generator against its own output. Refresh the derived source hash in the release inventory.",
  "validation": "All99construction entries, source addresses, source pins, schema/vector hashes, statuses and blockers are exact. Every non-whitespace JSON token is byte-identical. The only derived inventory input change is constructions.json; all other graph fields, counts and obligations are exact. The full first-authority command passes in21.61s, including its unchanged formatter and every contract, verifier, vector and lint stage.17registry checks, inventory and10inventory controls pass. All449runtime source hashes stay exact.",
  "summary": "The first-authority format check is green with only registry layout and its derived inventory hash changed; all construction tokens and security obligations stay exact.",
  "limitations": "Bookkeeping correction only; no app, test body, assertion, format contract, deadline, trust or gate change. The failed434attempt remains. Ten commands73\u201382remain; B functional fairness/past-index is still open. The broader deferred test/harness formatting patch remains untouched. No Stage5, signing, push, release preparation, publication or deployment.",
  "decisionTitle": "Keep construction registry values exact while satisfying its existing format check",
  "decision": "Normalize this mutable registry\u2019s layout rather than remove or relax the formatter. Verify both its entire token sequence and parsed values independently, then update only its inventory source hash. This does not authorize or apply the earlier deferred test/harness formatting patch.",
  "next": "Freeze435. Apply the already approved240s full-unit hang guard to the overlooked recovery-contract full-suite invocation only, preserving recovery-regressions120s and all other guards; record actual suite times. Complete commands73\u201382, then close continuous B native fairness and actual past-index fallback. PAUSE FOR COMMITS beforeStage5.",
